        72.0,
        92.98200225830078,
        289.3204040527344,
        108.30000305175781
      ],
      "text": "page 23). Spending a Magic point to cause the dagger to attack "
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        104.98200225830078,
        272.1681823730469,
        120.30000305175781
      ],
      "text": "for 1 round counts as Corbitt’s combat action for the round."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        128.98199462890625,
        271.70855712890625,
        144.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "Fighting \t 50% (Hard 25%/Extreme10%), damage 1D3 + \t"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "bbox": [
        117.0,
        140.98199462890625,
        284.60699462890625,
        156.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "damage bonus(1D4) + possible infection (see above)."
    },
    {
