        72.0,
        176.98199462890625,
        91.27799987792969,
        192.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "Skills"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        188.98199462890625,
        289.2861328125,
        204.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "Cthulhu Mythos 17%, Intimidate 64%, Listen 60%, Sleight "
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        200.98199462890625,
        167.6691131591797,
        216.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "of hand 30%, Stealth 72%."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        224.98199462890625,
        281.06866455078125,
        240.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "KEEPER’S NOTE: Only a few skills are listed for "
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        236.98199462890625,
        281.0692138671875,
        252.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "Corbitt—those that might come into play. You may "
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        248.98199462890625,
        175.58731079101562,
        264.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "improvise others if required."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        272.98199462890625,
        289.30474853515625,
        288.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Armor: Each point of armor reduces the damage received by "
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        284.98199462890625,
        289.2977600097656,
        300.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "1 point. Corbitt has cast Flesh Ward already. Roll 2D6 for "
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        296.98199462890625,
        289.26806640625,
        312.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "his armor. Reduce his armor by one point for each point of "
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        308.98199462890625,
        138.527099609375,
        324.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "damage he suffers."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        320.98199462890625,
        289.2682189941406,
        336.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Spells: Dominate (variant, see below), Flesh Ward, "
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        332.98199462890625,
        213.9731903076172,
        348.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Summon/Bind Dimensional Shambler."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        344.98199462890625,
        198.31280517578125,
        360.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Magical Artifact: Floating dagger."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        356.98199462890625,
        257.59503173828125,
        372.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Sanity Loss: 1/1D8 Sanity points to see him move."
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        386.3500061035156,
        277.0750427246094,
        417.4750061035156
      ],
      "text": "ABOUT W. CORBITT, ESQ"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        416.98199462890625,
        289.287841796875,
        432.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "He might be silent at first, but at some point during the "
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        428.98199462890625,
        289.2663269042969,
        444.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "confrontation with the investigators it will be more "
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        440.98199462890625,
        289.2950744628906,
        456.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "convincing to have him growl, screech, cackle, or mock. He "
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        452.98199462890625,
        153.73622131347656,
        468.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "does not breathe at all."
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        464.98199462890625,
        286.9830322265625,
        480.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Corbitt is not truly a vampire, nor any recognizable monster—"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        476.98199462890625,
        280.32305908203125,
        492.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "he is a sorcerer in the process of transforming himself into "
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        488.98199462890625,
        169.37100219726562,
        504.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "something entirely inhuman."
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        500.98199462890625,
        279.3051452636719,
        516.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "Sunlight causes him pain and is too bright for him to see "
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        512.9819946289062,
        279.3060607910156,
        528.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "comfortably. It might kill him, but whether it does so is for "
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        524.9819946289062,
        279.2781677246094,
        540.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "the Keeper to determine. Although he drinks blood for food, "
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        536.9819946289062,
        271.3140563964844,
        552.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "he could also eat carrots—drinking blood is just more fun."
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        548.9819946289062,
        278.2962646484375,
        564.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "His Flesh Ward spell operates as described below, but "
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        560.9819946289062,
        278.2872619628906,
        576.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "characterise its effect like this: bullets and blows only "
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        572.9819946289062,
        278.3151550292969,
        588.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "chip off pieces of his body, making him look even more "
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        584.9819946289062,
        278.30523681640625,
        600.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "horrific than he already does. His dried, iron-hard flesh is "
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        596.9819946289062,
        277.3052978515625,
        612.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "invulnerable so long as the spell holds. If damage exceeds "
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        608.9819946289062,
        277.31610107421875,
        624.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "the armor, his hit points reduce normally. He never heals "
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        620.9819946289062,
        277.2692565917969,
        636.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "and cannot be knocked unconscious. Reaching zero hit "
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        632.9819946289062,
        257.2272644042969,
        648.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "points, Corbitt crumbles into dust and never returns."
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        644.9819946289062,
        277.26214599609375,
        660.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "Corbitt controls the floating dagger, but if the "
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        656.9819946289062,
        276.27117919921875,
        672.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "investigators manage to wrest control of it and successfully "
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        668.9819946289062,
        276.2640380859375,
        684.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "stab Corbitt with it, he will quickly turn to ashes and dust, "
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        680.9819946289062,
        151.54202270507812,
        696.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "regardless of any spells."
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        77.97799682617188,
        384.32269287109375,
        96.69999694824219
      ],
      "text": "Corbitt’s Spells"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        92.98200225830078,
        529.2794189453125,
        108.30000305175781
      ],
      "text": "DOMINATE (Corbitt’s variant): Costs Corbitt 1 Magic "
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        104.98200225830078,
        435.97119140625,
        120.30000305175781
      ],
      "text": "point and takes one round to cast. "
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "bbox": [
        320.9988098144531,
        116.98200225830078,
        529.2756958007812,
        132.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "With his version of the Dominate spell, Corbitt can "
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        128.98199462890625,
        529.2586059570312,
        144.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "mentally cloud the mind of one investigator at a time, as long as "
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        140.98199462890625,
        529.2935791015625,
        156.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "the target is physically in the Corbitt house. The player should "
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        152.98199462890625,
        512.83056640625,
        168.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "make an opposed POW roll versus Corbitt’s POW of 90. "
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "bbox": [
        320.9988098144531,
        164.98199462890625,
        529.2672119140625,
        180.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "If Corbitt succeeds, the target is in a daze for 1D6+1 "
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        176.98199462890625,
        529.293212890625,
        192.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "combat rounds. While in this dazed state, the victim is "
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        188.98199462890625,
        529.2843627929688,
        204.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "subject to telepathic commands from Corbitt. These may "
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        200.98199462890625,
        529.2849731445312,
        216.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "take the form of subtle and creepy hallucinations or direct "
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        212.98199462890625,
        529.2670288085938,
        228.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "commands at the Keeper’s discretion. He or she will not "
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        224.98199462890625,
        529.2939453125,
        240.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "commit suicidal acts, though homicidal, idiotic, or reckless "
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        236.98199462890625,
        529.3013305664062,
        252.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "acts (such as trying to swallow a butcher’s knife) might be "
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        248.98199462890625,
        527.6292114257812,
        264.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "attempted. Waking, the victim will not recall what happened."
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        272.98199462890625,
        529.2608032226562,
        288.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "FLESH WARD: Corbitt will already have cast this spell "
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        284.98199462890625,
        529.2996826171875,
        300.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "before the investigators get to him, to provide himself with "
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        296.98199462890625,
        402.56414794921875,
        312.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "armor (see Armor above)."
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "bbox": [
        315.9988098144531,
        320.98199462890625,
        420.0914001464844,
        336.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "•\t Cost: variable magic points"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "bbox": [
        315.9988098144531,
        332.98199462890625,
        410.37982177734375,
        348.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "•\t Casting Time: 5 rounds"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        356.98199462890625,
        529.2865600585938,
        372.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Grants protection against physical attack. Each magic point "
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        368.98199462890625,
        529.302734375,
        384.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "spent gives the caster or the chosen target 1D6 points of "
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        380.98199462890625,
        527.7115478515625,
        396.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "armor against non-magical attacks. This protection wears off "
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        392.98199462890625,
        529.2673950195312,
        408.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "as it blocks damage. For example, if a character has 12 points "
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        404.98199462890625,
        529.302734375,
        420.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "of Flesh Ward as armor and suffers 8 points of damage, the "
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        416.98199462890625,
        529.28466796875,
        432.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "character suffers no damage but the Flesh Ward is reduced to 4 "
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        428.98199462890625,
        529.3106689453125,
        444.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "points. The spell lasts 24 hours or until the protection is used up. "
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "bbox": [
        320.9988098144531,
        440.98199462890625,
        529.2659912109375,
        456.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Once cast, the spell may not be reinforced with further magic "
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        452.98199462890625,
        527.6656494140625,
        468.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "points, nor recast until the old spell’s protection has been used up."
    }
  ],
